# M7 online, mode 1 (co-op): ${MACHINES} machines with ${LOCALS} local
# players each (virtual controllers) drive one level instance; every turn
# goes through the host. m0 hosts a private room, m1 joins with the code,
# the others with the invite link (the launcher path). m1 solves 0level,
# m0 walks to 1level and enters it, m1 solves it, then every player
# presses at once; the host ends the session and every machine must agree
# on the final state. Run by scripts/net/online-test.sh.
size 1280x720
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
expect state play baba/0level
@host online host private ${ROOMFILE}
@m1 online join code ${ROOMFILE}
@!m0,m1 online join invite ${ROOMFILE}
@host online wait 90 machines=${MACHINES}
@host online mode coop
online seats ${LOCALS}
@host shot 01-room
online wait 90 online session
online wait 60 players=${PLAYERS}
online settle 30
shot 02-session
@m1 l1 idle 900
@m1 l1 solve
online wait 90 baba/106level (map)
online settle 30
@m0 l1 idle 900
@m0 l1 walk 1level
@m0 l1 press wait
online wait-level 60 l1 baba/1level
online settle 30
@m1 l1 idle 900
@m1 l1 solve
online wait-icon 90 l1 1level 3
online settle 30
shot 03-after-win
online bots 8
online settle 60
shot 04-bots
@host online end
online wait 90 online room
online expect agreed
@host expect save 0 baba 1level 3
shot 05-room-after
quit
